# Source photographs are inputs, not outputs, and this repository is public.
# Sixteen people's original photographs are not published — only the portraits
# generated from them, and only once each person has approved their own.
# See docs/adr/0002-ai-generated-oc-portraits.md
assets/source-photos/*
!assets/source-photos/README.md

# Generated-image masters are inputs, not outputs — the site only serves the
# web-sized derivatives in public/artwork/ and public/frames/. Keeping masters
# out of git avoids permanently accumulating every regenerated painting.
# See docs/adr/0007-masters-out-of-git.md
assets/artwork-masters/

